@startuml U09_verification_pipeline_activity
!include style.iuml
title U09 — Verification pipeline (activity, final; replaces 01, state search instead of pattern matching)

start
:Parse the pathway JSON (pathway-core model);
:Structural checks:\nreferences, one Start, ≥1 End, node shapes,\nBFS from Start, reverse BFS from Ends;
if (fatal structure error?) then (yes)
  :Report structure errors;
else (no)
  :Explore every reachable marking (U10);
  if (control flow sound and search complete?) then (yes)
    :Data-flow fixed point (U11):\nmissing data;
  else (no)
  endif
  :Parse and type-check every branch condition;
endif
:Check task settings (DES-04):\nrole/service, deadline, escalation, retries and answer timeout,\nfallback, undo, duration, timer, override check, announced event;
:Deduplicate: one error per type, nodes and message,\nkeeping the shortest counterexample;
if (any error?) then (yes)
  :UNSAFE;
elseif (state limit reached?) then (yes)
  :TOO_LARGE;
else (no)
  :SAFE;
endif
stop
@enduml
